                    5/11/62–5/28/62. Secret.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d376-f2" n="1" xml:id="d376-f2-content">
                <p>A report, drafted by Sullivan and
                        Cross on May 24, in response to
                    section, “A. Political,” is ibid, Meetings and Memoranda Series, NSAM 157. It is
                    printed as an attachment to <ref target="#d379">Document 379</ref>. This report
                    was apparently a product of an inter agency working group established under the
                    chairmanship of William Sullivan; see
                        <ref target="#d370">Document 370</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
